': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alameddine, Rabih', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Wrong End of the Telescope (Book)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lebanon', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Transgender and Transsexuals', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality and Bisexuality', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-01T09:00:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joumana Khatib', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joumana', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Khatib', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/36bd5d8b-fcb0-5c88-87e8-bc2be48e3384', 'word_count': 1342, 'uri': 'nyt://article/36bd5d8b-fcb0-5c88-87e8-bc2be48e3384'}, {'abstract': 'In this southeastern Westchester community, ‘you don’t have the showiness that you do in some of the nearby towns.’', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/01/realestate/rye-brook-ny-a-low-profile-village-with-good-schools.html', 'snippet': 'In this southeastern Westchester community, ‘you don’t have the showiness that you do in some of the nearby towns.’', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lee Freund likes to say that his family’s house came with a dog. That’s because, two days after he and his wife, Jackie Freund, moved in with their children, Jordan, now 16, and Brooke, 13, Ms. Freund surprised them with an Australian labradoodle puppy. They named him Teddy.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/01/realestate/01LIVING-RYEBROOK-slide-AB4G/01LIVING-R