9/02/arts/music/mikis-theodorakis-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Known for his film music, he also waged a war of words and music against a military junta that banned his work and imprisoned him during its rule of Greece.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mikis Theodorakis, the renowned Greek composer and Marxist firebrand who waged a war of words and music against an infamous military junta that imprisoned and exiled him as a revolutionary and banned his work a half century ago, died on Thursday at his home in central Athens. He was 96.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/03/obituaries/Theodorakis-01/merlin_142937049_8166c095-858b-40a6-9438-71a3ce84f566-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 407, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/03/obituaries/Theodorakis-01/merlin_142937049_8166c095-858b-40a6-9438-71a3ce84f566-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 407}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/03/obituaries/Theodorakis-01/merlin_142937049_8166c095-858b-40a6-9438-71a3ce84f566-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 695, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/03/obituaries/Theodorakis-01/merlin_142937049_8166c095-858b-40a6-9438-71a3ce84f566-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1389, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/03/obituaries/Theodorakis-01/Theodorakis-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/03/obituaries/Theodorakis-0