of terminal cancer, an artist focused and refined his singular style of abstract painting right till the end.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/02/arts/design/thomas-nozkowski-pace-exhibition.html', 'snippet': 'In the face of terminal cancer, an artist focused and refined his singular style of abstract painting right till the end.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With a farmer’s diligence and a detective’s ingenuity, the painter Thomas Nozkowski marked out and cultivated a deceptively modest territory for nearly five decades. His harvest was inexhaustibly bountiful. “What I most respect about Nozkowski’s work is its endless inventiveness,” the sculptor Martin Puryear, who was his upstate New York neighbor and close friend, said in a phone interview. “Each of his paintings is its own story, and the story of the painting is in the painting.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/02/arts/02nozkowski-profile-2/merlin_193191792_19761ed1-69df-460a-a0c2-c9a731266ad2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/02/arts/02nozkowski-profile-2/merlin_193191792_19761ed1-69df-460a-a0c2-c9a731266ad2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/02/arts/02nozkowski-profile-2/merlin_193191792_19761ed1-69df-460a-a0c2-c9a731266ad2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/02/arts/02nozkowski-profile-2/merlin_193191792_19761ed1-69df-460a-a0c2-c9a731266ad2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'lega