/easy-weeknight-recipes.html', 'snippet': 'Caramelized zucchini pasta, slow-cooker tinga chicken tacos and more meals that are as simple as they are fun to make.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What a week. How’s everyone doing out there? I’ve been thinking of those affected by Hurricane Ida (and everything else). And I hope you are doing OK. We had some flooding, lost some treasured things. But my family is safe, and we are grateful.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/06/dining/as-caramelized-zucchini-pasta/merlin_192092256_44c23e41-ce25-4137-ac0d-651b194f2ddf-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/06/dining/as-caramelized-zucchini-pasta/merlin_192092256_44c23e41-ce25-4137-ac0d-651b194f2ddf-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/06/dining/as-caramelized-zucchini-pasta/merlin_192092256_44c23e41-ce25-4137-ac0d-651b194f2ddf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/06/dining/as-caramelized-zucchini-pasta/merlin_192092256_44c23e41-ce25-4137-ac0d-651b194f2ddf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/06/dining/as-caramelized-zucchini-pasta/merlin_192092256_44c23e41-ce25-4137-ac0d-651b194f2ddf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/06/dining/as-caramelized-zucchini-pasta/merlin_192092256_44c23e41-ce25-