sives were in the car and that drone operators took only a cursory scan of the courtyard before launching an attack.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/05/us/politics/military-drone-strike-kabul.html', 'snippet': 'A preliminary analysis said that it was “possible to probable” that explosives were in the car and that drone operators took only a cursory scan of the courtyard before launching an attack.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The U.S. military’s top officer asserted last week that a drone attack on a sedan near the airport in Kabul, Afghanistan, was a “righteous strike” that foiled a plot by the Islamic State in the waning hours of the immense evacuation effort.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/05/us/politics/05dc-dronestrike/merlin_193892649_2c020f0e-7cc3-4a95-8ec6-bf02df561371-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/05/us/politics/05dc-dronestrike/merlin_193892649_2c020f0e-7cc3-4a95-8ec6-bf02df561371-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/05/us/politics/05dc-dronestrike/merlin_193892649_2c020f0e-7cc3-4a95-8ec6-bf02df561371-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/05/us/politics/05dc-dronestrike/merlin_193892649_2c020f0e-7cc3-4a95-8ec6-bf02df561371-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/05/us/politics/05dc-dronestrike/05d