New Jersey, as residents call for more serious action on climate change.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As residents scrambled to clean up and assess damage from catastrophic flash floods that swept the Northeast last week, President Biden prepared to visit hard-hit areas in New York and New Jersey, where he will confront political ferment that is growing over the climate-driven disaster.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/10/04/us/04nystorm-biden-1/04nystorm-biden-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/10/04/us/04nystorm-biden-1/04nystorm-biden-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/10/04/us/04nystorm-biden-1/04nystorm-biden-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/10/04/us/04nystorm-biden-1/04nystorm-biden-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/10/04/us/04nystorm-biden-1/04nystorm-biden-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/10/04/us/04nystorm-biden-1/04nystorm-biden-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/10/04/us/04nystorm-biden-1/04nystorm-biden-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Biden to Visit Northeast Flood Zones as Demand Grows for Climate Action', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'President to Visit Northeast Flood Zones  As Demand Grows for Action on Climate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biden, Joseph R Jr', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schumer, Charles E', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Floods', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Ida (2021)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-05T22:36:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anne Barnard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a7727ae3-8c41-5956-8d1b-c9445b124fe8', 'word_count': 1044, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a7727ae3-8c41-5956-8d1b-c9445b124fe8'}, {'abstract': 'Texans are almost evenly divided on abortion, but a combination of Republican control, conservative judicial appointments and cultural shifts helped the state’s anti-abortion movement find success.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/05/us/anti-abortion-movement-texas-law.html', 'snippet': 'Texans are almost evenly divided on abortion, but a combination of Republican control, conservative judicial appointments and cultural shifts helped the state’s anti-abortion movement find success.', 'lead_paragraph': 'R