of tough, alienated characters, most memorably in Godard’s “Breathless.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, the rugged actor whose disdainful eyes, boxer’s nose, sensual lips and cynical outlook made him the idolized personification of youthful alienation in the French New Wave, most notably in his classic performance as an existential killer in Jean-Luc Godard’s “Breathless,” died on Monday at his home in Paris. He was 88.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/06/obituaries/06belmondo1-sub/merlin_184313073_1e5b8ba8-e552-4824-bb91-f6caef2cf6d8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 467, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/06/obituaries/06belmondo1-sub/merlin_184313073_1e5b8ba8-e552-4824-bb91-f6caef2cf6d8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 467}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/06/obituaries/06belmondo1-sub/merlin_184313073_1e5b8ba8-e552-4824-bb91-f6caef2cf6d8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 798, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/06/obituaries/06belmondo1-sub/merlin_184313073_1e5b8ba8-e552-4824-bb91-f6caef2cf6d8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1595, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/06/obituaries/06belmondo1-sub/merlin_184313073_1e5b8ba8-e552-4824-bb91-f6caef2cf6d8-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/06/obituaries/06belmondo1-sub/merlin_184313073_1e5b8ba8-e552-4824-bb91-f6