ue': 'Nichanian, Veronique', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hermes International SA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Men and Boys', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-07T11:00:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alice Newell-Hanson, Bruno Staub and Delphine Danhier', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alice', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Newell-Hanson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Bruno', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Staub', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Delphine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Danhier', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b4469282-cb2e-5a1f-9690-101d0ef43299', 'word_count': 3729, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4469282-cb2e-5a1f-9690-101d0ef43299'}, {'abstract': 'The gangster’s former refuge on Palm Island, Fla., near Miami Beach, is dividing residents and city officials: Should it be razed to make way for a modern home?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/07/us/al-capone-house.html', 'snippet': 'The gangster’s former refuge on Palm Island, Fla., near Miami Beach, is dividing residents and city officials: Should it be razed to make way for a modern home?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The mansion, on an island off Miami Beach, befitted the Prohibition-era crime leader: pearl white walls, a cabana for pool parties and a guesthouse for armed guards on the payroll to keep a look out for their boss, Al Capone.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'capti