ur energy levels.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/07/well/eat/coffee-caffeine-sleep-pressure.html', 'snippet': 'Lethargy, blood sugar and dehydration explain in part the paradoxical effects of coffee on our energy levels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Caffeine, the main active ingredient in coffee, has a well-justified reputation for being an energy booster. But caffeine is also a drug, which means that it can affect each of us differently, depending on our consumption habits and our genes.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/well/00askwell-coffee1/00askwell-coffee1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 460, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/14/well/00askwell-coffee1/00askwell-coffee1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 460}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/well/00askwell-coffee1/00askwell-coffee1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 785, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/well/00askwell-coffee1/00askwell-coffee1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1570, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/well/00askwell-coffee1/00askwell-coffee1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/14/well/00askwell-coffee1/00askwell-coffee1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'i