'Researchers took a deep dive into embryonic development to tease out the source of the tabby pattern in cats.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/07/science/cat-stripes-genetics.html', 'snippet': 'Researchers took a deep dive into embryonic development to tease out the source of the tabby pattern in cats.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Folklore is full of stories about the coat patterns of cats: How the tiger got its stripes. How the leopard got its spots. And scientists ask the same questions, although not necessarily about large predators. The research may focus instead on something like the mackerel tabby pattern in domestic shorthairs.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/science/07CAT-STRIPES/07CAT-STRIPES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/14/science/07CAT-STRIPES/07CAT-STRIPES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/science/07CAT-STRIPES/07CAT-STRIPES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/science/07CAT-STRIPES/07CAT-STRIPES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/science/07CAT-STRIPES/07CAT-STRIPES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/14/science/07CAT-STRIPES/07CAT-STRIPES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'th