ess Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kellen Browning and Erin Griffith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kellen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Browning', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Erin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Griffith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c9863680-17d0-57ad-8f4b-e026a2e8830b', 'word_count': 1179, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c9863680-17d0-57ad-8f4b-e026a2e8830b'}, {'abstract': 'In this lesson, students learn about the adventures of a New York Times travel reporter. Then, they plan their own road trip.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/08/learning/lesson-of-the-day-how-i-spent-my-pandemic-year-in-a-camper-van.html', 'snippet': 'In this lesson, students learn about the adventures of a New York Times travel reporter. Then, they plan their own road trip.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Note to our audience:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/21/travel/travel-camper-1-LN/travel-camper-1-articleLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/21/travel/travel-camper-1-LN/travel-camper-1-articleLarge-v4.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/21/travel/travel-camper-1-LN/travel-camper-1-jumbo-v4.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/21/travel/travel-camper-1-LN/travel-camper-1-superJumbo-v4.jpg', 'height': 1499, 'width': 1999, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy'