r coy about their religion-driven mission to stop abortion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/09/opinion/abortion-supreme-court-religion.html', 'snippet': 'Republican officeholders are no longer coy about their religion-driven mission to stop abortion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One hundred and fifty years ago, a woman named Myra Bradwell brought a U.S. Supreme Court case claiming a constitutional right to be admitted to the Illinois bar. She had passed the state’s bar exam with high honors, but the Illinois Supreme Court refused her application, saying that when the state General Assembly gave the court the power to grant law licenses, “it was with not the slightest expectation that this privilege would be extended to women.”', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/opinion/09greenhouse-lead/09greenhouse-lead-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 423, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/12/opinion/09greenhouse-lead/09greenhouse-lead-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 423}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/opinion/09greenhouse-lead/09greenhouse-lead-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 722, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/opinion/09greenhouse-lead/09greenhouse-lead-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1445, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/opinion/09greenhouse-lead/09greenhouse-lead-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumb