t to appear; Elaine Stritch arrived just in time. Recalling the “I Love New York” spot that helped dispel the fear in Times Square.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/09/theater/9-11-broadway-new-york-commercial.html', 'snippet': 'Rudy Giuliani was meant to appear; Elaine Stritch arrived just in time. Recalling the “I Love New York” spot that helped dispel the fear in Times Square.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Following the Sept. 11 terrorist attacks, Broadway suspended performances for just two days, reopening on Sept. 13, 2001. But audiences were hesitant to return, and many shows performed to near-empty houses for weeks.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/arts/12love-ny-theater1/merlin_10209981_abc9a560-a70b-453c-9608-14dc96d95a8e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/12/arts/12love-ny-theater1/merlin_10209981_abc9a560-a70b-453c-9608-14dc96d95a8e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/arts/12love-ny-theater1/merlin_10209981_abc9a560-a70b-453c-9608-14dc96d95a8e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/arts/12love-ny-theater1/merlin_10209981_abc9a560-a70b-453c-9608-14dc96d95a8e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/arts/12love-ny-theater1/12love-ny-theater1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnai