” for nearly 300 years. Now that he’s back on show, the famous painting looks quite different.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/09/arts/design/vermeer-cupid-restoration.html', 'snippet': 'An image of Cupid was covered over in “Girl Reading a Letter at an Open Window” for nearly 300 years. Now that he’s back on show, the famous painting looks quite different.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DRESDEN, Germany — After nearly three centuries behind a layer of paint, a naked Cupid has surfaced in one of the world’s best-loved artworks, drastically altering the background of a quiet interior scene.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/arts/09vermeer3/merlin_194384367_35cec034-20b9-412c-9314-6f7fee51dbb9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 762, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/14/arts/09vermeer3/merlin_194384367_35cec034-20b9-412c-9314-6f7fee51dbb9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 762}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/arts/09vermeer3/merlin_194384367_35cec034-20b9-412c-9314-6f7fee51dbb9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 807, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/arts/09vermeer3/merlin_194384367_35cec034-20b9-412c-9314-6f7fee51dbb9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1613, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/arts/09vermeer3/09vermeer3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/14/ar