s (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Learning', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shutdowns (Institutional)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poverty', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Asia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "United Nations Children's Fund", 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-09T12:52:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mujib Mashal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mujib', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mashal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dbf320a0-41d7-5416-b9dc-5e7c0f38dab4', 'word_count': 436, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dbf320a0-41d7-5416-b9dc-5e7c0f38dab4'}, {'abstract': 'A reader asks about navigating an office where vaccination is not required.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/09/style/office-masks-covid-social-qs.html', 'snippet': 'A reader asks about navigating an office where vaccination is not required.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My employer doesn’t require masks in the office, and most people don’t wear them — even in meeting rooms where social distancing is impossible. Still, I wear a mask, and I’d feel better if my colleagues did too. We returned to the office in June, before the Delta variant became widespread in my state and Covid infection rates were low. I’m vaccinated, but the vaccination rate is low in my area. (And our employer says we shouldn’t ask co-workers if they are vaccinated.) Is there a way to ask co-workers to wear masks in the office? I have young children who aren’t eligible for vaccination, and I want to keep them safe.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/20/fashion/socialqs-2021-artwork/socialqs-2021-artwork-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/06/20/fashion/socialqs-2021-artwork/socialqs-2021-artwork-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/20/fashion/socialqs-2021-artwork/socialqs-2021-artwork-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/20/fashion/socialqs-2021-artwork/socialqs-2021-artwork-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1713, 'width': 1712, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/20/fashion/socialqs-2021-artwork/socialqs-2021-artwork-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/06/20/fashion/socialqs-2021-artwork/socialqs-2021-artwork-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/20/fashion/socialqs-2021-artwork/socialqs-2021-artwork-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dear Colleagues, Will You Please Mask Up?', 'kicker': 'Social Q’s', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Please Wear a Mask', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Customs, Etiquette and Manners', 'rank': 1