, following a witness who described being raped by the singer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/09/nyregion/r-kelly-trial-rape.html', 'snippet': 'The second woman to testify on Thursday said Mr. Kelly was violent and possessive, following a witness who described being raped by the singer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One woman accused R. Kelly of locking her in his Chicago studio in 2003 and raping her while she was unconscious, and a second woman described the strictures and abuse she endured as one of the singer’s live-in girlfriends, as Mr. Kelly’s racketeering trial continued Thursday in Brooklyn.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/nyregion/09kelly01/merlin_157040475_0b8993c4-a51c-41c6-a5df-1828802d7622-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/09/nyregion/09kelly01/merlin_157040475_0b8993c4-a51c-41c6-a5df-1828802d7622-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/nyregion/09kelly01/merlin_157040475_0b8993c4-a51c-41c6-a5df-1828802d7622-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/nyregion/09kelly01/merlin_157040475_0b8993c4-a51c-41c6-a5df-1828802d7622-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/nyregion/09kelly01/09kelly01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/09/nyregion/09kelly