ntemporary-art-collaboration.html', 'snippet': 'The new art fair wants to be a “change agent” with more collaboration, global locations and a hyperlocal New York scene.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York’s newest art fair, Future Fair, intends to serve as a change agent — toward “an art market where people are collaborating and co-curating,” said Rachel Mijares Fick, who co-founded it with Rebeca Laliberte.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/10/arts/09futurefair-review1/merlin_194398005_dfda7576-fef6-4e37-9479-385f7d39bdfd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/10/arts/09futurefair-review1/merlin_194398005_dfda7576-fef6-4e37-9479-385f7d39bdfd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/10/arts/09futurefair-review1/merlin_194398005_dfda7576-fef6-4e37-9479-385f7d39bdfd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 677, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/10/arts/09futurefair-review1/merlin_194398005_dfda7576-fef6-4e37-9479-385f7d39bdfd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1355, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/10/arts/09futurefair-review1/merlin_194398005_dfda7576-fef6-4e37-9479-385f7d39bdfd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/10/arts/09futurefair-review1/merlin_194398005_dfda7576-fef6-4e37-9479-385f7d39bdfd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thu