kan Baila Music, Is Dead at 68', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sunil Perera, 68, Sri Lankan ‘Baila King’  Whose Lyrics Attacked the Political Elite', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perera, Sunil (1952-2021)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sri Lanka', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-09T19:31:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Aanya Wipulasena and Mujib Mashal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Aanya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wipulasena', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Mujib', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mashal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/761ab944-4f61-55fe-9e53-d6602428d711', 'word_count': 854, 'uri': 'nyt://article/761ab944-4f61-55fe-9e53-d6602428d711'}, {'abstract': 'In the last installment in his 12-play series, Richard Nelson asks how his characters, and the theater, got where they are today.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/09/theater/what-happened-the-michaels-abroad-review.html', 'snippet': 'In the last installment in his 12-play series, Richard Nelson asks how his characters, and the theater, got where they are today.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kate, a woman in her late 60s, sits alone at a weather-beaten table, the clutter of a cauliflower lasagna mostly cleared and her dinner companions now out for the evening. Together, they have spent most of the last two hours talking about Rose, Kate’s wife, who six months earlier, while dying of ovarian cancer, was killed by Covid-19 instead.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/arts/09the-michaels-abroad/merlin_193922724_b1efbdf8-c6f9-4d49-a42c-d7a144a99470-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/09/arts/09the-michaels-abroad/merlin_193922724_b1efbdf8-c6f9-4d49-a42c-d7a144a99470-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/arts/09the-michaels-abroad/merlin_193922724_b1efbdf8-c6f9-4d49-a42c-d7a144a99470-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 691, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/arts/09the-michaels-abroad/merlin_193922724_b1efbdf8-c6f9-4d49-a42c-d7a144a99470-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1383, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/arts/09the-michaels-abroad/09the-michaels-abroad-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/09/arts/09the-michaels-abroad/09the-michaels-abroad-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/arts/09the-michaels-abroad/09the-michaels-abroad-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: In ‘What Happened?,’ a Questioning Farewell to Rhinebeck', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Pick', 'content_kick