 {'abstract': 'The former president has sought to project patriotism after the American retreat from Afghanistan — but he will also appear at a boxing match on the 9/11 anniversary, and he continues to stoke racial divisions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/09/us/politics/trump-9-11-anniversary.html', 'snippet': 'The former president has sought to project patriotism after the American retreat from Afghanistan — but he will also appear at a boxing match on the 9/11 anniversary, and he continues to stoke racial divisions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Banished from social media and deprived of his national platform, former President Donald J. Trump has been clamoring for attention and trying to exploit the series of foreign and domestic crises that are testing the Biden administration.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/us/09political-briefing-trump/09political-briefing-trump-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/09/us/09political-briefing-trump/09political-briefing-trump-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/us/09political-briefing-trump/09political-briefing-trump-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/us/09political-briefing-trump/09political-briefing-trump-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/us/09political-briefing-trump/09political-briefing-trump-thumbStand