.html', 'snippet': 'Lawsuits will inevitably follow federal mandates to vaccinate — and they may come from surprising quarters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Only a year ago, cautious speculation had it that life would fully return to normal — perhaps by Thanksgiving of 2021. At the time it felt impossibly far-off, and in retrospect it seems naïvely optimistic. Few of us could have imagined the extent to which vaccine resistance would assert itself so aggressively, in so many different corners of society. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/nyregion/12big01/12big01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/12/nyregion/12big01/12big01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 422}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/nyregion/12big01/12big01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 721, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/nyregion/12big01/12big01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1442, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/nyregion/12big01/12big01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/12/nyregion/12big01/12big01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/nyregion/12big01/12big01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subT