act': 'Mr. Castelnuovo, who brought an incandescent charm to the screen, became famous during a golden age of Italian cinema. But his breakthrough role was in a French film.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/12/movies/nino-castelnuovo-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Castelnuovo, who brought an incandescent charm to the screen, became famous during a golden age of Italian cinema. But his breakthrough role was in a French film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nino Castelnuovo, a popular Italian film and television actor who found success beyond his home country when he starred alongside Catherine Deneuve in the soaringly sentimental French New Wave musical “The Umbrellas of Cherbourg,” died on Sept. 6 in Rome. He was 84.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/obituaries/09Castelnuovo/merlin_74174782_87dad597-e302-4737-8ba3-11ca2aa61df0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 613, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/09/obituaries/09Castelnuovo/merlin_74174782_87dad597-e302-4737-8ba3-11ca2aa61df0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 613}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/obituaries/09Castelnuovo/merlin_74174782_87dad597-e302-4737-8ba3-11ca2aa61df0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1003, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/obituaries/09Castelnuovo/merlin_74174782_87dad597-e302-4737-8ba3-11ca2aa61df0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1508, 'width': 1476, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/09/obituaries/09C