fb8907857a8'}, {'abstract': 'Dr. Viveck Murthy acknowledged the unhappiness the coronavirus had engendered, but added: “What we cannot allow is for this pandemic to turn us on each other. Our enemy is the virus. It is not one another.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/12/health/surgeon-general-murthy-vaccine-mandates.html', 'snippet': 'Dr. Viveck Murthy acknowledged the unhappiness the coronavirus had engendered, but added: “What we cannot allow is for this pandemic to turn us on each other. Our enemy is the virus. It is not one another.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dr. Vivek Murthy, the surgeon general, made the rounds on  Sunday television shows to defend the Biden administration’s new Covid vaccine mandates, portraying them as  narrow directives that apply only to specific professions where the federal government “has legal authority to act” — a direct counter to Republican accusations of unconstitutional federal overreach. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/business/12virus-briefing-murthy/merlin_194394522_1f431bd5-f26f-4ce8-8216-746bce64ac4e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/12/business/12virus-briefing-murthy/merlin_194394522_1f431bd5-f26f-4ce8-8216-746bce64ac4e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/business/12virus-briefing-murthy/merlin_194394522_1f431bd5-f26f-4ce8-8216-746bce64ac4e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/business/12virus-briefing-murthy/merlin_194394522_1f431bd5-f26f-4ce8-8216-746bce64ac4e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height':