l your plans?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/13/us/tell-us-about-your-second-pandemic-summer.html', 'snippet': 'Did life return to normal? Or did Delta foil your plans?', 'lead_paragraph': 'In June, as days stretched long, it really seemed as if the pandemic in the United States was waning. Mask came off. Restaurants and bars reopened. Americans began vacationing again.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tell Us About Your Second Pandemic Summer', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-13T20:17:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NYTNow', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/02c43fbf-71f8-5baa-9635-69099cab9afd', 'word_count': 130, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02c43fbf-71f8-5baa-9635-69099cab9afd'}, {'abstract': 'In a new brief in a major abortion case, a clinic and a doctor asked the court to strike down a state law largely banning the procedure after 15 weeks of pregnancy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/13/us/politics/mississippi-abortion-supreme-court.html', 'snippet': 'In a new brief in a major abortion case, a clinic and a doctor asked the court to strike down a state law largely banning the procedure after 15 weeks of pregnancy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Abortion providers in Mississippi urged the Supreme Court on Monday to reaffirm Roe v. Wade, the 1973 decision that established a constitutional right to abortion.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/13/us/13dc-scotus/merlin_194212731_86d5dd68-c16d-44ff-8