/article/eb620a27-1d50-519f-b624-5bd96e3b8490'}, {'abstract': 'A huge power failure after Hurricane Ida left vulnerable residents in sweltering apartments for days. At least 10 deaths in the city have been tied to the heat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/15/us/new-orleans-hurricane-ida-heat.html', 'snippet': 'A huge power failure after Hurricane Ida left vulnerable residents in sweltering apartments for days. At least 10 deaths in the city have been tied to the heat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW ORLEANS — In many ways, Iley Joseph’s one-bedroom apartment was an ideal place to ride out a hurricane. It was on the third floor — much too high to flood — of a building that was sturdy and new, part of a sleek, gated community for older residents like him.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/us/14nola-heatdeaths/merlin_194017290_88e3e85d-1027-447b-b16a-5e8d009bc2a1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/14/us/14nola-heatdeaths/merlin_194017290_88e3e85d-1027-447b-b16a-5e8d009bc2a1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/us/14nola-heatdeaths/merlin_194017290_88e3e85d-1027-447b-b16a-5e8d009bc2a1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/us/14nola-heatdeaths/merlin_194017290_88e3e85d-1027-447b-b16a-5e8d009bc2a1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/us/14nola-heatdeaths/merlin_194017290_88e3e85d-1027-447b-b16a-5e8d009bc2a1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/14/us/14nola-heatdeaths/merlin_194017290_88e3e85d-1027-447b-b16a-5e8d009bc2a1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/14/us/14nola-heatdeaths/merlin_194017290_88e3e85d-1027-447b-b16a-5e8d009bc2a1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Greatest Killer in New Orleans Wasn’t the Hurricane. It Was the Heat.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Riding Out Ida in New Orleans,  Only to Succumb to the Heat', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Ida (2021)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Heat and Heat Waves', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Orleans (La)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Power Failures and Blackouts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-15T09:00:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Bogel-Burroughs and Katy Reckdahl', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bogel-Burroughs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Katy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Reckdahl', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/06f232ad-1cf3-5577-a3a0-d083e7d26e5b', 'word_count': 1514, 'uri': 'nyt://article/06f232ad-1cf3-5577-a3a0-d083e7d26e5b'}, {'abstract': 'After a journey that began on the war-torn streets of Sierra Leone, the Dazed editor in chief is now one of fashion’s most influential stylists.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/15/fashion/how-ibrahim-kamara-found-his-place-in-fashion.html', 'snippet': 'After a journey that began on the war-torn streets of Sierra Leone, the Dazed editor in chief is now one of fashion’s most influential stylists.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ibrahim Kamara was sitting in a steamy hotel room in West Africa not long ago, reflecting on a fleeting visit to Gambia, a country he once called home. Born in Sierra Leone in 1990, Mr. Kamara fled to nearby Gambia after civil war broke out, spending much of his childhood with an aunt and uncle before settling in London with his parents at 16.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/23/fashion/15IbKamara-1/15IbKamara-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 899, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/23/fashion/15IbKamara-1/15IbKamara-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 899}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/23/fashion/15IbKamara-1/15IbKamara-1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 684, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/23/fashion/15IbKamara-1/15IbKamara-1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1367, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'u