s price tag, including state costs and campaign spending, a Sonoma State University professor said the total was at least $450 million.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The recall election is over, and Gov. Gavin Newsom held onto his office, leaving many Californians to ask: So how much did this whole thing cost?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/15/us/15newsom-analysis-6/merlin_194776638_1540033f-0917-435c-9e6a-be490d7076c1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/15/us/15newsom-analysis-6/merlin_194776638_1540033f-0917-435c-9e6a-be490d7076c1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/15/us/15newsom-analysis-6/merlin_194776638_1540033f-0917-435c-9e6a-be490d7076c1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/15/us/15newsom-analysis-6/merlin_194776638_1540033f-0917-435c-9e6a-be490d7076c1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/15/us/15newsom-analysis-6/15newsom-analysis-6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/15/us/15newsom-analysis-6/15newsom-analysis-6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/15/us/15newsom-analysis-6/15newsom-analysis-6-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150,