efing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-09-16T20:18:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NYTNow', 'section_name': 'Briefing', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melina Delkic', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Delkic', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'briefing', '_id': 'nyt://article/ccd4671c-d593-593e-97b6-645d90904aab', 'word_count': 1331, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ccd4671c-d593-593e-97b6-645d90904aab'}, {'abstract': 'The founder of Theranos is being tried on 12 counts of wire fraud and conspiracy to commit wire fraud. The trial is generally held Tuesdays, Wednesdays and Fridays.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/article/elizabeth-holmes-theranos-trial-updates.html', 'snippet': 'The founder of Theranos is being tried on 12 counts of wire fraud and conspiracy to commit wire fraud. The trial is generally held Tuesdays, Wednesdays and Fridays.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Erin Griffith (@eringriffith) and Erin Woo (@erinkwoo), two of our tech reporters, are covering the trial of Elizabeth Holmes, who dropped out of Stanford University to create the blood testing start-up Theranos at age 19 and built it to a $9 billion valuation and herself into the world’s youngest self-made female billionaire — only to flame out in disgrace after Theranos’s technology was revealed to have problems.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Follow the Elizabeth Holmes trial with our reporters in the courtroom.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Theranos Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Holmes, Elizabeth (1984- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-16T20:27:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/afb57717-ded2-5854-8461-f5ac66ca648f', 'word_count': 97, 'uri': 'nyt://article/afb57717-ded2-5854-8461-f5ac66ca648f'}, {'abstract': 'The defendant, Michael Sussmann, is accused of lying to the F.B.I. in a meeting about Trump and Russia. He denies wrongdoing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/16/us/politics/michael-sussmann-indictment-durham-investigation.html', 'snippet': 'The defendant, Michael Sussmann, is accused of lying to the F.B.I. in a meeting about Trump and Russia. He denies wrongdoing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The special counsel appointed by the Trump administration to scrutinize the Russia investigation obtained a grand jury indictment on Thursday of a prominent cybersecurity lawyer, accusing him of lying to the F.B.I. five years ago during a meeting about Donald J. Trump and Russia.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/16/us/16dc-sussmann1/merlin_184320819_244327bb-2460-4b9c-af5d-762f256be26d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 499, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/16/us/16dc-sussmann1/merlin_184320819_244327bb-2460-4b9c-af5d-762f256be26d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 499}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/16/us/16dc-sussmann1/merlin_184320819_244327bb-2460-4b9c-af5d-762f256be26d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 852, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': No