_id': 'nyt://article/87dd2b00-7a7a-5e41-8233-07143bd61c97', 'word_count': 1413, 'uri': 'nyt://article/87dd2b00-7a7a-5e41-8233-07143bd61c97'}, {'abstract': 'Lauren Annunziata and Gabriel Piscione thought they met in high school, until her relative unearthed a photo of them eating pizza together at a children’s birthday party 10 years earlier.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/17/style/lauren-annunziata-gabriel-piscione-wedding.html', 'snippet': 'Lauren Annunziata and Gabriel Piscione thought they met in high school, until her relative unearthed a photo of them eating pizza together at a children’s birthday party 10 years earlier.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Lauren Annunziata sat down to eat pizza at her cousin’s birthday party in October 1995 at Kids N’ Action, a children’s entertainment center in Brooklyn, she had no idea that her future husband was at the same table as her. In fact, the only evidence that remains of Ms. Annunziata and Gabriel Vincent Piscione’s first meeting is a photo taken by Ms. Annunziata’s relative, Terry Cartusciello, where the future couple sat only a few feet away from each other.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/fashion/00MINI-PiscioneAnnunziata-02/00MINI-PiscioneAnnunziata-02-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/19/fashion/00MINI-PiscioneAnnunziata-02/00MINI-PiscioneAnnunziata-02-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/fashion/00MINI-PiscioneAnnunziata-02/00MINI-PiscioneAnnunziata-02-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credi