easons of beloved shows and new versions of things you’ve seen many times before.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fall television returns to normal this year after the pandemic wipeout of 2020, with the broadcast networks presenting their usual full schedules. But what’s normal these days?', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '82', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/arts/19new-tv-listings-starwars-visions/merlin_193681014_3fe64b65-e233-4317-95c7-391fe8f5ab72-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 253, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/19/arts/19new-tv-listings-starwars-visions/merlin_193681014_3fe64b65-e233-4317-95c7-391fe8f5ab72-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 253}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/arts/19new-tv-listings-starwars-visions/merlin_193681014_3fe64b65-e233-4317-95c7-391fe8f5ab72-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 432, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/arts/19new-tv-listings-starwars-visions/merlin_193681014_3fe64b65-e233-4317-95c7-391fe8f5ab72-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 865, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/arts/19new-tv-listings-starwars-visions/19new-tv-listings-starwars-visions-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/19/arts/19new-tv-listings-starwars-visions/19new-tv-listings-starwars-visions-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/arts/19new-tv-listings-starwars-visions/19new-tv-listings-starwars-visions-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fall TV 2021: The 31 Shows to Watch', 'kicker': 'Fall Preview', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Television Listings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Autumn (Season)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-17T13:02:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Hale', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hale', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1941fabb-4dc7-597f-8694-16e20bb8ba52', 'word_count': 2306, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1941fabb-4dc7-597f-8694-16e20bb8ba52'}, {'abstract': 'From an enormous roundup of Black American portraits to a two-city retrospective of Jasper Johns, the new art season is buzzing again — and as busy as it ever was.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/17/arts/design/art-museums-shows-exhibitions-fall-calendar.html', 'snippet': 'From an enormous roundup of Black American portraits to a two-city retrospective of Jasper Johns, the new art season is buzzing again — and as busy as it ever was.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After the pandemic brought museum and gallery shows to a dead stop, last year’s racial justice protests lent new urgency to demands that institutions become more transparent, more representative and more diverse. While there’s certainly an uptick of shows featuring women and artists of color in this fall preview, there are also many, delayed by Covid-19, that were planned several years ago. For the moment, at least, it feels as if we are picking up just where we left off — with solo blockbusters (like Jasper Johns’s, stretching over two cities), art fairs (nearly all in person, again) and ancient treasures (rare ceramics, from Thailand to Mesopotamia). Check museums and fairs for health-related updates: Museums may require proof of vaccination, and fairs may yet migrate back online.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '106', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/arts/19NEW-ART-LISTINGS-nov1/merlin_193443147_da3111e5-03ef-46fe-8449-fc09eb9c607a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 725, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/19/arts/19NEW-ART-LISTINGS-nov1/merlin_193443147_da3111e5-03ef-46fe-8449-fc09eb9c607a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 725}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/arts/19NEW-ART-LISTINGS-nov1/merlin_193443147_da3111e5-03ef-46fe-8449-fc09eb9c607a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 848, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/arts/19NEW-ART-LISTINGS-nov1/merlin_193443147_da3111e5-03ef-46fe-8449-fc09eb9c607a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1696, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/arts/19NEW-ART-LISTINGS-nov1/19NEW-ART-LISTINGS-nov1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/19/arts/19NEW-ART-LISTINGS-nov1/19NEW-ART-LISTINGS-nov1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/arts/19NEW-ART-LISTINGS-nov1/19NEW-ART-LISTINGS-nov1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'These Are the Art Shows and Events to See This Season', 'kicker': 'Fall Preview', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Art Listings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Whitney Museum of American Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Museum of Art', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ART INSTITUTE OF CHICAGO', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Asia Society', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Aldrich Contemporary Art Museum', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baltimore Museum of Art', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Academy of Music', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Museum', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cleveland Museum of Art', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Zwirner, David, Gallery', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Yale University Art Gallery', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Smithsonian Institution', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bard Graduate Center for Studies in the Decorative Arts', 'rank': 16, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-17T13:03:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Will Heinrich', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Will', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Heinrich', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/91caab55-2858-51b3-9fc7-9ed11c466b1d', 'word_count': 4179, 'uri': 'nyt://article/91caab55-2858-51b3-9fc7-9ed11c466b1d'}, {'abstract': 'Anticipated returns (Abba, Diana Ross), intergenerational collaborations (Lady Gaga and Tony Bennett) and hotly tipped follow-ups (Brandi Carlile, Makaya McCraven) are coming in the new season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/17/arts/music/fall-music-pop-jazz-calendar.html', 'snippet': 'Anticipated returns (Abba, Diana Ross), intergenerational collaborations (Lady Gaga and Tony Bennett) and hotly tipped follow-ups (Brandi Carlile, Makaya McCraven) are coming in the new season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When pandemic lockdowns shut down the concert industry last year, some artists forged ahead with planned album releases and answered a question loaded with risk: What would a rollout look like without the regular promotional cycle of in-person interviews, late-night performances and live shows? Many musicians pivoted to streaming; others buckled down on their songwriting and hit the studio. The results of these experiments are largely emerging now.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '90', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/arts/19new-pop-listings-brandi-lead/19new-pop-listings-brandi-lead-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/19/arts/19new-pop-listings-brandi-lead/19new-pop-listings-brandi-lead-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 4