iving rooms for 37 years.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Is Drama? The Bungled Plan at ‘Jeopardy!’ to Choose a New Host', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Game Shows', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sony Pictures Entertainment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Richards, Mike (1975- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trebek, Alex', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Jeopardy! (TV Program)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-17T17:09:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Podcasts', 'section_name': 'Podcasts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dodai Stewart, Michael M. Grynbaum, Nicole Sperling, Tracy Mumford, Tally Abecassis, Phyllis Fletcher, Wendy Dorr and Corey Schreppel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dodai', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stewart', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f4f979fc-7c66-5924-85d1-6edf0af43307', 'word_count': 228, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f4f979fc-7c66-5924-85d1-6edf0af43307'}, {'abstract': 'Adding fried pepperoni to a classic recipe with garlic and olive oil gives it a bacon-like brawniness and a chile kick.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/17/dining/pasta-garlic-olive-oil-pepperoni.html', 'snippet': 'Adding fried pepperoni to a classic recipe with garlic and olive oil gives it a bacon-like brawniness and a chile kick.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As much as I adore long-simmered pasta sauces like Bolognese or Marcell