d_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://audiocontainer/e7890cf6-3d09-553c-b227-100730168ce5'}, {'abstract': 'Commit a few — or all — of these dishes to memory, and you’ll always have a delicious meal at the ready.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/17/dining/14-classic-recipes.html', 'snippet': 'Commit a few — or all — of these dishes to memory, and you’ll always have a delicious meal at the ready.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We all have one — a dish we don’t need a recipe for. The prepping, cooking and serving has become second nature, like a dance you’ve danced a million times before. When you whip it together from memory on a busy weeknight or at a vacation rental, it makes you feel a little accomplished, like you’ve figured it all out. (Even if it’s just for that brief shining moment.) The collection of recipes below, which is by no means a definitive list, includes those that you might want to work on memorizing next. They are back-pocket dishes that will never do you wrong.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/17/dining/17classicroundup-everyday-pancakes/17classicroundup-everyday-pancakes-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 392, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/17/dining/17classicroundup-everyday-pancakes/17classicroundup-everyday-pancakes-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 392}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/17/dining/17classicroundup-everyday-pancakes/17classicroundup-everyday-pancakes-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/17/dining/17classicroundup-everyday-pancakes/17classicroundup-everyday-pancakes-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1