he depth of France’s anger.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/17/world/europe/france-ambassador-recall-us-australia.html', 'snippet': 'It is the first time in the long history of the French-U.S. alliance that a top diplomat has been recalled, illustrating the depth of France’s anger.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Calling American and Australian behavior “unacceptable between allies and partners,” France announced on Friday that it was recalling its ambassadors to both countries in protest over President Biden’s decision to provide nuclear-powered submarines to Australia.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/17/us/17political-briefing-france/merlin_194887809_27dddf7f-dab9-4759-8638-e48395033c17-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/17/us/17political-briefing-france/merlin_194887809_27dddf7f-dab9-4759-8638-e48395033c17-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/17/us/17political-briefing-france/merlin_194887809_27dddf7f-dab9-4759-8638-e48395033c17-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/17/us/17political-briefing-france/merlin_194887809_27dddf7f-dab9-4759-8638-e48395033c17-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/17/us/17political-briefing-france/merlin_194887809_27dddf7f-dab9-4759-8638-e48395033c17-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'widt