/cdc-pfizer-vaccine-efficacy.html', 'snippet': 'The study found that the shots’ effectiveness in preventing hospitalization fell to 77 percent from 91 percent four months after full vaccination.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Centers for Disease Control and Prevention released data on Friday indicating that the level of protection against Covid hospitalizations afforded by the Pfizer-BioNTech vaccine dropped significantly in the four months after full inoculation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/17/us/17virus-briefing-vaccine/merlin_194578806_0bf7d989-774c-4069-87ec-b6e4dbf4d9c9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/17/us/17virus-briefing-vaccine/merlin_194578806_0bf7d989-774c-4069-87ec-b6e4dbf4d9c9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/17/us/17virus-briefing-vaccine/merlin_194578806_0bf7d989-774c-4069-87ec-b6e4dbf4d9c9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/17/us/17virus-briefing-vaccine/merlin_194578806_0bf7d989-774c-4069-87ec-b6e4dbf4d9c9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/17/us/17virus-briefing-vaccine/merlin_194578806_0bf7d989-774c-4069-87ec-b6e4dbf4d9c9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/17/us/17virus-briefing-vaccine/merlin_194578806_0bf7d989-774c-4069-87ec-b6e4dbf4d