, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/opinion/19yablokov/19yablokov-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/opinion/19yablokov/19yablokov-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1435, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/opinion/19yablokov/19yablokov-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/19/opinion/19yablokov/19yablokov-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/opinion/19yablokov/19yablokov-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'There’s a Reason Putin Keeps Winning', 'kicker': 'Guest Essay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Navalny, Aleksei A', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Propaganda', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-19T14:55:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ilya Yablokov', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ilya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yablokov', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/9535761d-b196-56f3-8db4-9e1a2262299f', 'word_count': 1122, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9535761d-b196-56f3-8db4-9e1a2262299f'}, {'abstract': 'Start with a Times classic: Marian Burros’s recipe for a delicious plum torte.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/19/dining/what-to-cook-this-week.html', 'snippet': 'Start with a Times classic: Marian Burros’s recipe for a delicious plum torte.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. The New York Times published Marian Burros’s recipe for plum torte (above) in 1983, and did so again every September for six years. Requests for copies of that recipe continued to flood in through the 1990s, but it wasn’t until the birth of New York Times Cooking in the fall of 2014 that we could give it a permanent home. It’s a true taste of the shoulder season between summer and fall, and one of the greatest easy desserts of all time, a perfect Sunday project. Please make it with whatever fruit you can manage today, and raise a glass to Marian when you do. We walk in her footsteps every day.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/07/dining/plumtorte/plumtorte-articleLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/09/07/dining/plumtorte/plumtorte-articleLarge-v4.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/07/dining/plumtorte/plumtorte-jumbo-v4.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/07/dining/plumtorte/plumtorte-superJumbo-v4.jpg', 'height': 1368, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/07/dining/plumtorte/plumtorte-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/09/07/dining/plumtorte/plumtorte-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/07/dining/plumtorte/plumtorte-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What to Cook This Week', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Content Type: Service', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-19T15:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Sifton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sifton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/3a5023c9-791d-57f6-8427-b85bb14b57d2', 'word_count': 631, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3a5023c9-791d-57f6-8427-b85bb14b57d2'}, {'abstract': 'Our lives are loud — and too often it costs money to escape the noise.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/19/opinion/silence-noise.html', 'snippet': 'Our lives are loud — and too often it costs money to escape the noise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Recently, I wanted to find a moment to journal, pray, and simply be still, so I went to a riverbank near my home. I sat listening to birds, eyeing the languid joy of sunbathing turtles, charting fallen leaves eddying in the green current. A roar broke the silence. A leaf blower. I tried to find a quieter spot, but leaf blowers seemed to follow me. Everywhere. It was like some secret society of leaf blowers conspired against me. I kept looking, but quiet was elusive. Wherever I went I found the whooshes of road noise, the clack-clack-clacking of construction, or the blare of televisions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/opinion/19warren/19warren-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/19/opinion/19warren/19warren-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/opinion/19warren/19warren-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/opinion/19warren/19warren-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/opinion/19warren/19warren-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/19/opinion/19warren/19warren-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/19/opinion/19warren/19warren-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How Silence Became a Luxury Product', 'k