ews in the neighboring state of Mizoram. Having grown up in a Jewish family without ever fully embracing the religion of my observant parents, I was intrigued and wanted to know more.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/20/travel/20travel-india-myanmar-promo/merlin_188880870_f9c2e5b3-1313-413f-8c84-57a48bf4a8a2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/20/travel/20travel-india-myanmar-promo/merlin_188880870_f9c2e5b3-1313-413f-8c84-57a48bf4a8a2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/20/travel/20travel-india-myanmar-promo/merlin_188880870_f9c2e5b3-1313-413f-8c84-57a48bf4a8a2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/20/travel/20travel-india-myanmar-promo/merlin_188880870_f9c2e5b3-1313-413f-8c84-57a48bf4a8a2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/20/travel/20travel-india-myanmar-promo/20travel-india-myanmar1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/20/travel/20travel-india-myanmar-promo/20travel-india-myanmar1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/20/travel/20travel-india-myanmar-promo/20travel-india-myanmar1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, '