on the Indigenous vote; also on economic issues like income distribution and taxing the ultra-wealthy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/20/world/canada/election-jagmeet-singh-NDP.html', 'snippet': 'The party has focused on the Indigenous vote; also on economic issues like income distribution and taxing the ultra-wealthy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ditching a collared dress shirt for a sleeveless hoodie, Jagmeet Singh, the leader of the left-leaning New Democratic Party, sways to the music in a recent TikTok video recreating a viral dance trend, with text overlaid about how youth voters are “going to make history” this election.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/20/world/20canada-election-briefing-NDP/merlin_194895102_ec3d40cf-c9f7-4f7f-8f43-9a4abcee6865-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/20/world/20canada-election-briefing-NDP/merlin_194895102_ec3d40cf-c9f7-4f7f-8f43-9a4abcee6865-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/20/world/20canada-election-briefing-NDP/merlin_194895102_ec3d40cf-c9f7-4f7f-8f43-9a4abcee6865-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/20/world/20canada-election-briefing-NDP/merlin_194895102_ec3d40cf-c9f7-4f7f-8f43-9a4abcee6865-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/20/world/20canada-election-briefing-NDP/20canada-election-briefing-NDP-thumbStandard.jpg', 