': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f86b493a-9b9e-51cb-a757-8b835b71d520', 'word_count': 1541, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f86b493a-9b9e-51cb-a757-8b835b71d520'}, {'abstract': 'In 2008, Paul Azinger led the United States to victory over Europe after dividing his team into three four-man “pods.” Would that system change the Americans’ luck this year?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/21/sports/golf/ryder-cup-team-usa-stricker.html', 'snippet': 'In 2008, Paul Azinger led the United States to victory over Europe after dividing his team into three four-man “pods.” Would that system change the Americans’ luck this year?', 'lead_paragraph': '“Pod” is not a golf word. And yet it has been on the tongue of nearly everyone in the golf community during the last, tense days before this week’s Ryder Cup, the biennial, pressure-packed team competition between American and European pro golfers that begins Friday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/22/sports/21golf-ryder-print/merlin_194839857_fe77930a-3409-4ed2-b4d3-2c11f520701a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 306, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/22/sports/21golf-ryder-print/merlin_194839857_fe77930a-3409-4ed2-b4d3-2c11f520701a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 306}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/22/sports/21golf-ryder-print/merlin_194839857_fe77930a-3409-4ed2-b4d3-2c11f520701a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 522, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/22/sports/21golf-ryder-print/merlin_194839857_fe77930a-3409-4ed2-b4d3-2c11f520701a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1045, 'width': 204