nt of a metal cage large enough to accommodate a panther — one hand on strap of bag, one hand on hip, head tilted interrogatively as they peer into the shadows in an effort to make meaningful eye contact with this large, elderly bird. Explanation as to the meaning of this whole scene: unavailable.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '53', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/26/magazine/26mag-Kyiv-promo/26mag-Kyiv-08-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/26/magazine/26mag-Kyiv-promo/26mag-Kyiv-08-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/26/magazine/26mag-Kyiv-promo/26mag-Kyiv-08-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/26/magazine/26mag-Kyiv-promo/26mag-Kyiv-08-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/26/magazine/26mag-Kyiv-promo/26mag-Kyiv-08-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/26/magazine/26mag-Kyiv-promo/26mag-Kyiv-08-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/26/magazine/26mag-Kyiv-promo/26mag-Kyiv-08-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'My Accidental Visit to the Pandemic’s Party Capital', 'kicker': 'The Voyages Issue', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Open City', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantine (Life and Culture)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Loneliness', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kyiv (Ukraine)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-21T09:00:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rosa Lyster and Gueorgui Pinkhassov/Magnum, for The New York Times', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rosa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lyster', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Gueorgui', 'middlename': 'Pinkhassov', 'lastname': 'Magnum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0036d274-ae8e-5f1e-ba22-9d064bb9cee5', 'word_count': 2521, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0036d274-ae8e-5f1e-ba22-9d064bb9cee5'}, {'abstract': 'An irreverent historian who gets her hands into traditional cooking, farming and crafts is finally, at 79, winning fame with Netflix’s “High on the Hog.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/21/dining/leni-sorensen-food-scholar-historian.html', 'snippet': 'An irreverent historian who gets her hands into traditional cooking, farming and crafts is finally, at 79, winning fame with Netflix’s “High on the Hog.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'CROZET, Va. — You p