ac654b96-f8bc-5548-a5e6-2d734a665efe'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Kelly’s dealings with the singer when she was underage are the earliest events in the sprawling racketeering charge the R&B star faces.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/22/nyregion/aaliyah-r-kelly.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Kelly’s dealings with the singer when she was underage are the earliest events in the sprawling racketeering charge the R&B star faces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Aaliyah, the R&B star whom R. Kelly married when she was just 15, figured prominently in the government’s closing argument against Mr. Kelly on Wednesday, as a federal prosecutor presented the pair’s illegal union as a criminal act underlying the racketeering charge.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/22/nyregion/22rkellytrial-briefing-closings-aaliyah/22rkellytrial-briefing-closings-aaliyah-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/22/nyregion/22rkellytrial-briefing-closings-aaliyah/22rkellytrial-briefing-closings-aaliyah-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/22/nyregion/22rkellytrial-briefing-closings-aaliyah/22rkellytrial-briefing-closings-aaliyah-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/22/nyregion/22rkellytrial-briefing-closings-aaliyah/22rkellytrial-briefing-closings-aaliyah-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/22/nyregion/22rkellytrial-