after her appointment as the court’s first woman justice, it’s worth reflecting on the path she took.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/23/opinion/sandra-day-oconnor-supreme-court.html', 'snippet': 'Forty years after her appointment as the court’s first woman justice, it’s worth reflecting on the path she took.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This has been a month of sad remembrances — the 20th anniversary of Sept. 11, of course, and the anniversary last Saturday of the death of Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg. An additional, less noted anniversary is an occasion not for sorrow but for wonder. Forty years ago this Saturday, on Sept. 25, 1981, Sandra Day O’Connor took her seat on the Supreme Court.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/25/arts/23greenhouse-image/05BOOKjp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 528, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/25/arts/23greenhouse-image/05BOOKjp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 528}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/25/arts/23greenhouse-image/05BOOKjp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 901, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/25/arts/23greenhouse-image/05BOOKjp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1803, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/25/arts/23greenhouse-image/05BOOKjp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/25/arts/23greenhouse-image/05BOOKjp-thumbSt