ns plays a dreamy, pleasure-driven android in this delightful near-future romance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/23/movies/im-your-man-review.html', 'snippet': 'Dan Stevens plays a dreamy, pleasure-driven android in this delightful near-future romance.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Your eyes are like two mountain lakes I could sink into” is a compliment most women would be disinclined to take umbrage at. But Alma (Maren Eggert) is not most women: A prickly scientist and cuneiform expert, she’s interested neither in flattery nor the man who’s delivering it. His name is Tom (Dan Stevens), he’s gorgeous, and he’s available. He is also a robot.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/21/arts/imyourman1/imyourman1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 334, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/21/arts/imyourman1/imyourman1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 334}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/21/arts/imyourman1/imyourman1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 570, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/21/arts/imyourman1/imyourman1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1141, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/21/arts/imyourman1/imyourman1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/21/arts/imyourman1/imyourman1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': '