f the Pfizer-BioNTech vaccine to many Americans, including older people and those with medical conditions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A committee of scientific advisers to the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention voted on Thursday to recommend booster doses of the Pfizer-BioNTech coronavirus vaccine to many Americans, including older people and those with certain underlying medical conditions, but excluded those at risk because of their jobs. The panel debated a number of thorny questions before reaching a decision that will shape the federal government’s guidance.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/23/world/23virus-briefing-acipmembers-1/merlin_192798429_153812df-0f70-4b9f-9066-08cae2927fa9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/23/world/23virus-briefing-acipmembers-1/merlin_192798429_153812df-0f70-4b9f-9066-08cae2927fa9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/23/world/23virus-briefing-acipmembers-1/merlin_192798429_153812df-0f70-4b9f-9066-08cae2927fa9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/23/world/23virus-briefing-acipmembers-1/merlin_192798429_153812df-0f70-4b9f-9066-08cae2927fa9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/23/world/23virus-briefing-acipmembers-1/23virus-briefing-acipmembers-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbS