 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/b6e279a9-bff0-5ecd-864e-d7803fbbc473', 'word_count': 1253, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b6e279a9-bff0-5ecd-864e-d7803fbbc473'}, {'abstract': 'His humorous touch was evident in commercials for Wendy’s, Little Caesars, Fox Sports and many other clients. “We have to win with wit,” he once said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/24/business/media/cliff-freeman-dead.html', 'snippet': 'His humorous touch was evident in commercials for Wendy’s, Little Caesars, Fox Sports and many other clients. “We have to win with wit,” he once said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cliff Freeman, the award-winning copywriter and creative director behind many witty television commercials, most memorably the one for Wendy’s in which a gravelly-voiced old woman shouts, “Where’s the beef?,” at the sight of a puny hamburger patty in an oversized bun, died on Sept. 5 at his home in Manhattan. He was 80.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/25/obituaries/23Freeman1/merlin_12076153_b71ade06-d99f-4a2f-a1c3-9ffaa6fb111d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 907, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/25/obituaries/23Freeman1/merlin_12076153_b71ade06-d99f-4a2f-a1c3-9ffaa6fb111d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 907}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/25/obituaries/23Freeman1/merlin_12076153_b71ade06-d99f-4a2f-a1c3-9ffaa6fb111d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 678, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/25/obituaries/23Freeman1/merlin_12076153_b71ade06-d99f-4a2f-a1c3-9ffaa6fb111d-