', '_id': 'nyt://article/e1679a2d-7447-55c4-8351-8351392c4bd7', 'word_count': 681, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e1679a2d-7447-55c4-8351-8351392c4bd7'}, {'abstract': '“We mourn, we comfort, we are in pain, too,” said Hari P. Close, the president of the National Funeral Directors & Morticians Association.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/26/us/covid-black-morticians-funeral-homes.html', 'snippet': '“We mourn, we comfort, we are in pain, too,” said Hari P. Close, the president of the National Funeral Directors & Morticians Association.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Black-owned funeral businesses, the pain of the coronavirus pandemic has been two-pronged: Many funeral workers are mourning their own colleagues who have died from the virus, all while experiencing burnout from having to preside over countless services for their Black patrons and neighbors who have died at disproportionate rates from Covid.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/20/lens/20virus-briefing-black-morticians1/merlin_194463783_659ad719-a2f2-4461-ba45-1cc97d6793cc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/20/lens/20virus-briefing-black-morticians1/merlin_194463783_659ad719-a2f2-4461-ba45-1cc97d6793cc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/20/lens/20virus-briefing-black-morticians1/merlin_194463783_659ad719-a2f2-4461-ba45-1cc97d6793cc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/20/lens/20virus-briefing-black-morticians1/merlin_194463783_659ad719-a2f2-4461-ba45-1cc97d6793cc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365,