n Los Angeles or the shrimp tacos at Toloache in New York, both of which are superb. They might wail at Eric Kim’s latest recipe for The Times, for a sheet-pan shrimp gratin (above). They needn’t. It’s a marvelous meal: an exterior of crunch-melty cheese, with a creamy shrimp mixture beneath it that uses shiitakes to add a savory oomph.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/21/dining/EK-sheet-pan-shrimp-gratin/EK-sheet-pan-shrimp-gratin-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/21/dining/EK-sheet-pan-shrimp-gratin/EK-sheet-pan-shrimp-gratin-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/21/dining/EK-sheet-pan-shrimp-gratin/EK-sheet-pan-shrimp-gratin-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/21/dining/EK-sheet-pan-shrimp-gratin/EK-sheet-pan-shrimp-gratin-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/21/dining/EK-sheet-pan-shrimp-gratin/EK-sheet-pan-shrimp-gratin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/21/dining/EK-sheet-pan-shrimp-gratin/EK-sheet-pan-shrimp-gratin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/21/dining/EK-sheet-pan-shrimp-gratin/EK-sheet-pan-shrimp-gratin-thumb