ction_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Helene Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Helene', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e6077551-eb5a-5209-b3a9-92b729345a3d', 'word_count': 547, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e6077551-eb5a-5209-b3a9-92b729345a3d'}, {'abstract': 'The pop superstar’s new album is a stunner. But she had to walk a dark road to get there.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/28/podcasts/billie-eilish-and-the-pursuit-of-happiness.html', 'snippet': 'The pop superstar’s new album is a stunner. But she had to walk a dark road to get there.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The pop superstar’s new album is a stunner. But she had to walk a dark road to get there.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Billie Eilish and the Pursuit of Happiness', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-09-28T14:56:37+0000', 'document_type': 'audiocontainer', 'news_desk': 'Podcasts', 'section_name': 'Podcasts', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://audiocontainer/74431915-9f6e-57cb-9dc5-e96db078a22d', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://audiocontainer/74431915-9f6e-57cb-9dc5-e96db078a22d'}, {'abstract': 'It’s called a circumtriple planet, and evidence that one exists suggests that planet formation is less unusual than once believed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/28/science/triple-sun-planet.html', 'snippet': 'It’s called a circumtriple planet, and evidence that one exists suggests that planet formation is less unusual than once believed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GW Ori is a star system 1,300 light years from Earth in the constellation of Orion. It is surrounded by a huge disk of dust and gas, a common feature of young star systems that are forming planets. But fascinatingly, it is a system with not one star, but three.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'This May Be the First Planet Found Orbiting 3 Stars at Once', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Planets', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stars and Galaxies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Space and Astronomy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Monthly Notices of the Royal Astronomical Society (Journal)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-28T15:14:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': "By Jonathan O'Callaghan", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "O'Callaghan", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dcd9863e-9f3e-58f3-ac63-3cb247c6dad2', 'word_count': 743, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dcd9863e-9f3e-58f3-ac63-3cb247c6dad2'}, {'abstract': 'Powers transcript', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/28/podcasts/transcript-ezra-klein-interviews-richard-powers.html', 'snippet': 'Powers transcript', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every Tuesday and Friday, Ezra Klein invites you into a conversation about something that matters, like today’s episode with Richard Powers. Listen wherever you get your podcasts.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Transcript: Ezra Klein Interviews Richard Powers', 'kicker': 'The Ezra Klein Show', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-09-28T15:20:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Podcasts', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/d3f65591-aeaa-57d0-acc9-ffcc29cc44dc', 'word_count': 11916, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d3f65591-aeaa-57d0-acc9-ffcc29cc44dc'}, {'abstract': 'Jarrod W. Ramos had pleaded guilty to murder charges in one of the deadliest attacks on American journalists. In July, a jury found him criminally responsible for the 2018 shooting in Maryland’s capital.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/28/us/jarrod-ramos-capital-gazette.html', 'snippet': 'Jarrod W. Ramos had pleaded guilty to murder charges in one of the deadliest attacks on American journalists. In July, a jury found him criminally responsible for the 2018 shooting in Maryland’s capital.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The man who stormed into the newsroom of a community newspaper chain in Maryland’s capital in 2018, killing five staff members, was sentenced on Tuesday to five consecutive life terms without the possibility of parole, according to prosecutors.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/28/us/28xp-gazette-01/28xp-gazette-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/28/us/28xp-gazette-01/28xp-gazette-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/28/us/28xp-gazette-01/28xp-gazette-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/28/us/28xp-gazette-01/28xp-gazette-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'hei