lications', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Beijing Bytedance Technology Co Ltd', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'TikTok (ByteDance)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-28T15:37:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tiffany Hsu', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tiffany', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hsu', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/442d749e-f988-5495-8cb4-a2f02ce449b8', 'word_count': 996, 'uri': 'nyt://article/442d749e-f988-5495-8cb4-a2f02ce449b8'}, {'abstract': 'Steph Davis and Ian Mitchard, daredevil sky divers, wingsuit flyers and BASE jumpers, married nearly three years ago. Just two months after their wedding their life changed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/28/style/reaching-new-heights-together.html', 'snippet': 'Steph Davis and Ian Mitchard, daredevil sky divers, wingsuit flyers and BASE jumpers, married nearly three years ago. Just two months after their wedding their life changed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not long before their wedding on Nov. 3, 2018, Ian Mitchard and Steph Davis were sitting in their home in Moab, Utah, talking about death. For them, it was not an uncomfortable or even uncommon conversation. As wingsuit flyers, BASE jumpers and sky divers, they regularly spent more time in the air than some species of birds. The possibility of dying? “It’s in our face all the time,” Mr. Mitchard, now 40, said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/28/fashion/28Unions-WingsuitCouple2/28Unions-WingsuitCouple1-02-articleLa