'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roslyn Sulcas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roslyn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sulcas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2cbc4ae5-bb5a-5ba8-850a-9b4acaa38b4a', 'word_count': 1209, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2cbc4ae5-bb5a-5ba8-850a-9b4acaa38b4a'}, {'abstract': 'If you’re finding it difficult to socialize again, we’d love to hear from you.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/28/nyregion/are-you-dealing-with-social-anxiety.html', 'snippet': 'If you’re finding it difficult to socialize again, we’d love to hear from you.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As we head into fall, some of us will look back fondly on our “post-vax” summer as a time of outings with friends, family reunions, or a return to dating from the isolation of Covid-19 restrictions. But the last few months have come with an unexpected downside: social anxiety.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Are you dealing with social anxiety?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Anxiety and Stress', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shyness', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-09-28T20:42:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NewsDesk', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Wolfe', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wolfe', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c5e186a6-4bd5-5f73-89ac-c44145820c5a', 'word_count': 165, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c5e186a6-4bd5-5f73-89ac-c44145820c5a'}, {'abstract': 'The Los Angeles Lakers player added that he would not use his platform to publicly encourage others to be inoculated against the coronavirus.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/28/sports/basketball/lebron-james-covid-vaccine.html', 'snippet': 'The Los Angeles Lakers player added that he would not use his platform to publicly encourage others to be inoculated against the coronavirus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LeBron James, the Los Angeles Lakers star, said on Tuesday that he had been vaccinated against the coronavirus, after evading questions about his vaccination status last season. Several other high-profile N.B.A. players have resisted getting vaccinated before the start of the N.B.A. season next month.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/28/world/28virus-briefing-jamesvaccine-1/merlin_195498237_dca80794-1249-40ed-b54c-73adc642eab4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/28/world/28virus-briefing-jamesvaccine-1/merlin_195498237_dca80794-1249-40ed-b54c-73adc642eab4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/28/world/28virus-briefing-jamesvaccine-1/merlin_195498237_dca80794-1249-40ed-b54c-73adc642eab4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/28/world/28virus-briefing-jamesvaccine-1/merlin_195498237_dca80794-1249-40ed-b54c-73adc642eab4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/28/world/28virus-briefing-jamesvaccine-1/merlin_195498237_dca80794-1249-40ed-b54c-73adc642eab4-thumbStand