d_count': 1152, 'uri': 'nyt://article/610930e7-8203-5e5d-b18b-3c5714bbd55d'}, {'abstract': 'For decades, politicians have rewarded wealth over work, putting big corporate interests above working families. That has to stop.\xa0', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/29/opinion/government-biden-families.html', 'snippet': 'For decades, politicians have rewarded wealth over work, putting big corporate interests above working families. That has to stop.\xa0', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even in normal times, the nation’s economic policies can often feel detached from the daily lives of millions of Americans who get up and go to work each day, terrified that they might slip out of the middle class — or never make it in — but for me, an economist advising President Biden, the struggle to achieve economic security is deeply personal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/28/reader-center/28boushey_3/merlin_190652466_dbc23aac-7cd0-4e40-8791-2a150dc2c2ba-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/28/reader-center/28boushey_3/merlin_190652466_dbc23aac-7cd0-4e40-8791-2a150dc2c2ba-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/28/reader-center/28boushey_3/merlin_190652466_dbc23aac-7cd0-4e40-8791-2a150dc2c2ba-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/28/reader-center/28boushey_3/merlin_190652466_dbc23aac-7cd0-4e40-8791-2a150dc2c2ba-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None