sn’t not address it either. Asked if he’ll run again, he is noncommittal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/29/arts/television/al-franken-comedy.html', 'snippet': 'Onstage, the ex-senator and “S.N.L.” star doesn’t exactly address his fall from grace. But he doesn’t not address it either. Asked if he’ll run again, he is noncommittal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was a fairly typical night at the Comedy Cellar’s Village Underground with a procession of young comics telling jokes about bickering couples, body issues and unglamorous sex. After Matteo Lane finished his set with a story about sleeping with a porn star, the curveball came: The host introduced “the only performer on the lineup who was a United States senator.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/30/arts/29al-franken-promo/merlin_194835759_d1e4d4a2-28a2-4256-a1d1-6521b9c03703-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/30/arts/29al-franken-promo/merlin_194835759_d1e4d4a2-28a2-4256-a1d1-6521b9c03703-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/30/arts/29al-franken-promo/merlin_194835759_d1e4d4a2-28a2-4256-a1d1-6521b9c03703-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/30/arts/29al-franken-promo/merlin_194835759_d1e4d4a2-28a2-4256-a1d1-6521b9c03703-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/30/arts/2