rticle/73a67dc0-109d-5443-a664-b3f899e7b0dd'}, {'abstract': 'The extent to which Ms. Everard’s attacker wielded his powers as a police officer in the horrific attack has prompted a wave of new calls for reform in the London police department.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/30/world/europe/sarah-everard-wayne-couzens-sentencing.html', 'snippet': 'The extent to which Ms. Everard’s attacker wielded his powers as a police officer in the horrific attack has prompted a wave of new calls for reform in the London police department.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The police officer who abducted, raped and murdered Sarah Everard was sentenced on Thursday to life in prison by Britain’s top criminal court, after two days of hearings that reignited outrage at the way London’s police department handles cases involving violence against women.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/30/world/30uk-everard/merlin_195582552_cb1df64c-22fc-410f-ad1f-a5df160b2933-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/30/world/30uk-everard/merlin_195582552_cb1df64c-22fc-410f-ad1f-a5df160b2933-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/30/world/30uk-everard/merlin_195582552_cb1df64c-22fc-410f-ad1f-a5df160b2933-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/30/world/30uk-everard/merlin_195582552_cb1df64c-22fc-410f-ad1f-a5df160b2933-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit'